---
title: "A decision memo: draft, propose while it stays open, then you decide"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: ready
    lg1: draft
    lg2: proposed
    lg3: decided
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 yellow
  class lg3 teal
  s0: No memo yet
  s1: You have read the problem, the customer, the principles, and who may decide
  s2: An incomplete memo is an open draft
  s3: The memo you mean to finish is an open draft
  s4: The draft names the customer, the problem, and a solution
  s5: A finding is recorded for the FAQ
  s6: The FAQ cites that finding
  s7: The decision matrix still shows the memo as open
  s8: Proposed, and still open
  s9: Decided by you
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you read what the venture already holds
  s1 --> s2: you draft a memo and leave the sections empty
  s2 --> s3: you open the memo you mean to propose
  s3 --> s4: you write the customer narrative
  s4 --> s5: you record a finding
  s5 --> s6: you add the FAQ and cite the finding
  s6 --> s7: you run the decision matrix
  s7 --> s8: you propose the memo, and it stays open
  s8 --> s9: you decide
  class s0 tan
  class s1 tan
  class s2 blue
  class s3 blue
  class s4 blue
  class s5 blue
  class s6 blue
  class s7 blue
  class s8 yellow
  class s9 teal
